+# FreqUI 汉化术语表 / zh-CN Glossary
+
+Binding terminology for the Simplified Chinese translation of FreqUI (Binance / OKX USDT-M
+perpetual futures context). Every translator uses exactly these terms. If you need a new term,
+add it here (keep the table sorted by section), and use it consistently.
+
+Many of these terms already exist as shared keys in `src/locales/*/common.json`
+(`common.terms.*`, `common.actions.*`, `common.status.*`, `common.time.*`). Reuse those keys
+where the text is identical instead of creating duplicates.
+
+## 1. Core terms (mandatory)
+
+| English | 中文 | Notes |
+| --- | --- | --- |
+| Trade | 交易 | A single trade / position record. Count unit: 笔 (e.g. `3 笔交易`) |
+| Open trades | 当前持仓 | |
+| Closed trades | 已平仓交易 | |
+| Profit | 收益 | Negative values are still 收益 (shown with sign); use 亏损 only for "Loss" |
+| Profit % | 收益率 | |
+| Stake / Stake amount | 投入金额 | |
+| Pair | 交易对 | |
+| Whitelist | 白名单 | |
+| Blacklist | 黑名单 | |
+| Backtest / Backtesting | 回测 | |
+| Dry-run | 模拟盘 | |
+| Live | 实盘 | |
+| Force entry | 手动开仓 | |
+| Force exit | 强制平仓 | |
+| Entry | 开仓 | |
+| Exit | 平仓 | |
+| Long | 做多 | |
+| Short | 做空 | |
+| Leverage | 杠杆 | |
+| Funding fee(s) | 资金费 | |
+| Drawdown | 回撤 | |
+| Max drawdown | 最大回撤 | |
+| Win rate | 胜率 | |
+| Lock / Pair lock | 锁定 | e.g. "Pair locks" panel = 交易对锁定 |
+| Stoploss | 止损 | |
+| ROI | ROI（止盈表） | Freqtrade `minimal_roi` table (full-width brackets); in tight spaces (column headers) `ROI` alone is fine |
+| Timeframe | 周期 | e.g. 5m / 1h stay as-is |
+| Candle | K线 | |
+| Balance | 余额 | |
+| Performance | 表现 | |
+| Dashboard | 仪表盘 | |
+| Logs | 日志 | |
+| Settings | 设置 | |
+| Bot | 机器人 | |
+| Strategy | 策略 | |
+| Hyperopt | 参数优化 | |
+| Pairlist | 交易对列表 | |
+| Profit factor | 盈亏比 | |
+| Expectancy | 期望值 | |
+| Sharpe | 夏普比率 | |
+| Sortino | 索提诺比率 | |
+| Calmar | 卡玛比率 | |
+| Duration | 持仓时长 | For non-trade durations (e.g. backtest run time) use 耗时 / 时长 |
+| Trade count | 交易次数 | |
+| Order | 订单 | |
+| Fee | 手续费 | |
+| Unrealized | 未实现 | e.g. Unrealized profit = 未实现收益 |
+
+## 2. Additional trading terms
+
+| English | 中文 | Notes |
+| --- | --- | --- |
+| Realized | 已实现 | Realized profit = 已实现收益 |
+| Total profit | 总收益 | |
+| Cumulative profit | 累计收益 | |
+| Absolute profit / Profit abs | 收益额 | |
+| Relative profit | 收益率 | |
+| Current profit | 当前收益 | |
+| Close profit | 平仓收益 | |
+| Loss | 亏损 | |
+| Wins / Losses / Draws | 盈利 / 亏损 / 持平 | Counts of trades |
+| Open rate | 开仓价 | |
+| Close rate | 平仓价 | |
+| Current rate | 当前价 | |
+| Amount | 数量 | Base-currency amount |
+| Price | 价格 | |
+| Open date | 开仓时间 | |
+| Close date | 平仓时间 | |
+| Exit reason | 平仓原因 | Values from the bot (`roi`, `stop_loss`, `exit_signal` ...) stay untranslated |
+| Entry tag / Enter tag | 开仓标签 | Tag values stay untranslated |
+| Exchange | 交易所 | |
+| Futures | 合约 | |
+| Spot | 现货 | |
+| Margin | 保证金 | |
+| Margin mode (isolated / cross) | 保证金模式（逐仓 / 全仓） | API values `isolated`/`cross` stay as-is when sent |
+| Trading mode | 交易模式 | |
+| Liquidation price | 强平价格 | |
+| Position | 仓位 | |
+| Position adjustment / DCA | 加仓（仓位调整） | |
+| Partial exit | 部分平仓 | |
+| Force exit partial (trade action) | 部分强制平仓 | Keeps the Force exit term 强制平仓 |
+| Unlimited stake (`stake_amount: "unlimited"`) | 按余额均分（unlimited） | Not "no limit": the available balance is split evenly across `max_open_trades`. Bot status: `USDT 余额均分为 5 份` |
+| Order side buy / sell (display) | 买入 / 卖出 | Order rows in trade detail; `ft_order_side` values stay as sent |
+| Order type | 订单类型 | |
+| Limit order / Market order | 限价单 / 市价单 | |
+| Open order(s) | 挂单 | "Cancel open order" = 撤销挂单 |
+| Filled | 已成交 | |
+| Cancelled | 已撤销 | |
+| Stoploss on exchange | 交易所止损单 | |
+| Trailing stop | 追踪止损 | |
+| Max open trades | 最大持仓数 | |
+| Starting balance | 初始余额 | |
+| Final balance | 最终余额 | |
+| Market change | 市场涨跌幅 | |
+| CAGR | 年化收益率（CAGR） | Column headers / backtest metric selector: 年化收益率 |
+| SQN | SQN | Keep abbreviation |
+| Best pair / Worst pair | 最佳交易对 / 最差交易对 | |
+| Avg. duration | 平均持仓时长 | |
+| Winners / Losers | 盈利交易 / 亏损交易 | e.g. "Avg. Duration winners" = 盈利交易平均持仓时长 |
+| Currency | 币种 | |
+| Stake currency | 计价币种 | e.g. USDT |
+| Wallet | 钱包 | |
+| Dry-run wallet | 模拟盘钱包 | |
+| Simulated balances (dry-run `/balance` note) | 模拟盘余额 | Display mapping of the fixed note sent by the bot |
+| Python timedelta from the bot (`1 day, 2:00:00`) | `1天 2:00:00` | `formatTimedelta()`; display only |
+| Exit tag | 平仓标签 | Tag values stay untranslated |
+| Mix tag / Mixed tag (enter + exit tag) | 组合标签 | |
+| Trading volume (in stake currency) | 成交额 | e.g. BotProfit "Trading volume" |
+| Starting capital | 初始资金 | Backtest form; "Starting balance" stays 初始余额 |
+| Protections | 保护机制 | "Enable Protections" = 启用保护机制 |
+| Funding rate | 资金费率 | Candle type `funding_rate` |
+| Mark / Index / Premium index (candle types) | 标记价格 / 指数价格 / 溢价指数 | |
+| Trading mode `margin` (display) | 杠杆 | As in the Binance UI; the API value `margin` stays as sent |
+| Demo trading / exchange demo account (`demo_trading`) | 交易所模拟账户 | Bot status "(Demo)" = （交易所模拟账户）. Real orders go to the exchange's demo environment; not the same as Dry-run (模拟盘) |
+| ROI as "return" (BotProfit "ROI closed trades") | 收益 | Only the `minimal_roi` table is ROI（止盈表） |
+| Margin mode isolated / cross (display) | 逐仓 / 全仓 | Backtest "Trading Mode" row: `逐仓合约`; API values stay as sent |
+| Position adjustment (chart marker tooltip) | 仓位调整 | "Long adjustment" = 做多仓位调整 (covers both adding and partial exits) |
+| Order not filled yet ("(open)" chart label) | 未成交 | "Long (open)" = 做多（未成交） |
+| Open / High / Low / Close (candle tooltip) | 开盘 / 最高 / 最低 / 收盘 | |
+| Trailing stop positive / positive offset | 盈利后追踪止损 / 启动追踪止损的盈利偏移 | Backtest settings rows |
+| Wallet balance (backtest metrics suffix) | 钱包余额 | "Max Drawdown (wallet balance)" = 最大回撤（钱包余额） |
+
+## 3. Bot / UI terms
+
+| English | 中文 | Notes |
+| --- | --- | --- |
+| Start / Stop (bot) | 启动 / 停止 | |
+| Pause / Stop entry (stopbuy / stopentry) | 暂停开仓 | |
+| Reload config | 重载配置 | |
+| Strategy parameters | 策略参数 | |
+| Webserver mode | Webserver 模式 | |
+| Chart | 图表 | |
+| Indicator | 指标 | |
+| Volume | 成交量 | |
+| Plot config / Plot configuration | 绘图配置 | |
+| Heikin Ashi | 平均K线（Heikin Ashi） | Chart toolbar checkbox: 平均K线 (short form) |
+| Timerange | 时间范围 | |
+| Download data | 下载数据 | |
+| Pairlist config | 交易对列表配置 | |
+| Lookahead analysis | 未来函数分析 | Detects lookahead bias ("未来函数") |
+| Recursive analysis | 递归分析 | |
+| Backtest result | 回测结果 | |
+| Notes | 备注 | |
+| Custom data | 自定义数据 | |
+| Layout | 布局 | Lock layout = 锁定布局 |
+| Auto refresh | 自动刷新 | |
+| Login / Logout | 登录 / 退出登录 | |
+| Username / Password | 用户名 / 密码 | |
+| API URL | API 地址 | |
+| Hourly profit | 每小时收益 | |
+| Daily / Weekly / Monthly | 每日 / 每周 / 每月 | |
+| Profit distribution | 收益分布 | |
+| Trades log | 交易记录 | |
+| Wallet history | 钱包历史 | Wallet chart y-axis (balance values): 钱包余额 |
+| Trade history | 交易历史 | |
+| Background jobs | 后台任务 | |
+| FreqAI | FreqAI | Product name, keep |
+| N/A | N/A | Keep (also used by formatters/tests) |
+| Detail timeframe (`timeframe_detail`) | 细分周期 | |
+| Periodic breakdown | 按时间段统计 | Tabs: 按日 / 按周 / 按月 / 按年 / 按星期 |
+| Period breakdown / Daily breakdown / Time breakdown | 按时间段统计 / 每日统计 / 按时间段统计 | Trade page tab and PeriodBreakdown heading use the same term |
+| Single trades (trade list in backtest result) | 交易明细 | |
+| Exchange trades / tick data (download-data option) | 逐笔成交 | "Download Trades instead of OHLCV data" |
+| Bot state running / paused / stopped | 运行中 / 已暂停 / 已停止 | Display only; values from the bot stay as sent |
+| Background job status pending / running / success / failed | 等待中 / 运行中 / 已完成 / 失败 | Display only |
+| Signal (entry / exit signal) | 信号（开仓信号 / 平仓信号） | Chart: "Long entry" = 做多开仓, "Short exit" = 做空平仓 |
+| Lookahead bias / biased signals | 未来函数 / 有偏差的信号 | Lookahead analysis results |
+| Startup candles / startup candle count | 启动K线 / 启动K线数量 | Recursive analysis (`startup_candle_count`) |
+| Plot configurator | 绘图配置器 | |
+| Main plot / Subplot | 主图 / 副图 | `main_plot` / `subplots` keys stay as-is |
+| Mark area / Chart areas | 标记区域 / 图表区域 | |
+| Live data (chart data fetched from the exchange) | 实时数据 | Not the same as Live (实盘) |
+| Projected profit (incl. unrealized) | 预计收益（含未实现） | Cumulative profit chart |
+| Profit over time | 收益走势 | Dashboard panel |
+| Multi pane (trade page) | 多功能面板 | |
+| Pairs combined | 交易对汇总 | |
+| Bins (histogram) | 分组数 | Profit distribution chart |
+| Evaluate (pairlist) | 评估 | Pairlist configurator: "Evaluate pairlist" = 评估交易对列表 |
+| Generating pairlist | 生成型交易对列表 | e.g. StaticPairList / VolumePairList (names stay as-is) |
+| Bars (chart measure tool) | 根K线 | `12 根K线（-3.21%）` |
+| Online / Offline (bot) | 在线 / 离线 | |
+| Toggle night mode | 切换夜间模式 | |
+| Copy (name suffix) | 副本 | Duplicated config name: `default 副本` |
+| At risk (stake at risk at stoploss) | 风险金额 | Trade detail |
+| Position value | 仓位价值 | |
+| Current stoploss dist | 当前止损距离 | |
+| Initial stoploss | 初始止损 | |
+| Supported / Unsupported (exchanges) | 官方支持 / 未经官方支持 | Exchange select. Unsupported = not officially supported by freqtrade (may or may not work via ccxt) |
+| Hyperopt space (strategy parameters) | 参数空间 | `buy` / `sell` / `protection` space names stay as-is |
+| L- / S- prefix (long / short tag) | 多- / 空- | |
+| Futures/Margin (trade detail section) | 合约/杠杆 | Consistent with trading mode `margin` = 杠杆 |
+
+## 4. Style rules
+
+- Natural, concise Simplified Chinese as used by Chinese crypto futures traders; prefer short
+  labels for buttons, column headers and tabs (2-6 characters where possible).
+- Full-width punctuation in Chinese sentences: `，。：；（）！？`. Keep half-width characters
+  inside technical tokens (`5m`, `USDT`, `BTC/USDT:USDT`, `%`).
+- Put a half-width space between Chinese text and Latin words / numbers / placeholders:
+  `共 {count} 笔交易`, `在 Binance 上`, `杠杆 {leverage}x`.
+- Use 您 sparingly; neutral imperative is preferred (`请输入密码`, not `您需要输入您的密码`).
+- Ellipsis: `…` (or keep `...` when it is part of the original UI pattern, e.g. loading).
+- Never translate: API field names, pair symbols, strategy names, enum values sent to the API,
+  CSS classes, route paths, log content coming from the bot, numbers, timeframes, currency codes,
+  exchange names, exit reasons and entry tags coming from the bot.
